Web-only, applied by build-web.sh and reverted after the build.
On web, expo-audio's forDuration timer calls stop() a second time, and web stop() throws once the
recorder has stopped, so a take that hits the 3-minute cap can be lost. The record screen's own
interval already stops at MAX_SECONDS, so the web build records without forDuration.

